[ti:Ek Ghade]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Ek chilam... ek baabaa... do ghade ka khel...
[00:14.92]Ek ghada tha poora... ek thaa toota...
[00:21.84]Aaj maine ajab tamaashaa dekha
[00:28.76]Baabaa aur do ghade sang khel
[00:35.68]Subah shaam wo ghade uthaave
[00:42.60]Pani bhare rojana kaam
[00:49.51]Toota ghada roya, aansu bahaaya
[00:56.43]Haye re mere baabaa
[01:03.35]Teri mehnat bekaar jaaye
[01:10.27]Tu roj bhaare, main roj giraaun
[01:17.19]Teri pyaas bhi na bujh paaye
[01:24.11]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[01:31.03]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[01:37.95]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[01:44.87]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye ✨
[01:58.70]Tan par maans naam baraabar
[02:05.62]Kandhe jhoole janeu dhaagaa
[02:12.54]Main hoon toota, main hoon bekaar
[02:19.46]Mujhse kyun uthaaye baabaa?
[02:26.38]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[02:33.30]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[02:40.22]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[02:47.14]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye ✨
[02:54.06]Tu dekhe jo phool raah mein khilte
[03:00.98]Hariyali chhaayi, mahak uthi hai
[03:07.89]Wo teri ek ek boond ka karishma
[03:14.81]Tu khud ko anjaan rakhti hai
[03:21.73]Lead: Main andha tha!
[03:28.65]Lead: Apni darar ko rog samjha!
[03:35.57]Lead: Par teri nazar ne rang dikhaaya!
[03:42.49]Lead: Mera wo chhed – mera hi geet ban gaya!
[03:49.41]Toota ghada gaaye! Toota ghada gaaye!
[03:56.33]Baabaa bole – mat ro deewaane
[04:03.25]Jo lage vyarth wohi saphal hai
[04:10.17]Har boond mein saagar hai
[04:17.08]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[04:24.00]Aaj nahi to kal wapas!
[04:30.92]Kal wapas! Kal wapas!
[04:37.84]Nahi akaarth koi karm...
[04:44.76]Sab aaj nahi... to kal wapas...
